; Investment Portfolio Journal - Brokerage Account 2024
;
; Lot tracking convention: manual subaccounts
;   Account format: assets:broker:<ticker>:<acquisition-date>_$<cost-basis>
;   Example: assets:broker:acme:2024-01-15_$45.50 holds shares bought on 2024-01-15 at $45.50
;
; Disposal rules:
;   - Default: FIFO by acquisition date (earliest lot disposed first)
;   - Gift lots: use the donor's original acquisition date for FIFO ordering
;   - Specific identification: marked with "disposal:spec-id" comment
;
; Realized gains = sale proceeds - cost basis of disposed lots
; Gains are recorded in revenues:gains (credit/negative = gain)

